   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Video to clip**\n\nInstantHMR reads the body in each frame, Live Avatar Motion turns it into a clip of the avatar's params. RT-DETR boxes keep InstantHMR on the person; without them the whole frame is one person.\n\nThe performer's usual facing and lean become the avatar's front and rest. Upper-body avatars drop the leg tracks.\n\nThe clip appears as a button in the viewer on the Save node. Chain more Motion nodes for more clips."
   ],
   "title": "Live Avatar Motion"
  },
